  "name": "Question 2",
  "problem": "Find the domain of $m(x)=9\\sqrt[7]{5x-3}+4.$\n\n$x\\in ($\n{{field-1}},\n\n{{field-2}} $).$",
  "worked_solution": "The domain of $\\sqrt[7]{x}$ is\n$x\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).$\n\nTransformations do not change this interval. Therefore, the domain of $m(x)$ is $x\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).$",
